# Rebel Coffee Orders as an agent (verified with HAPI 1.3.0 + Enterprise A2A plugin)
# Start:  hapi serve orders --mcp --a2a --a2a-name "Rebel Coffee Orders" --a2a-description "Look up coffee orders"
# Preview without serving:  hapi serve orders --a2a --dry-run
@base = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Discover the agent: its public Agent Card
GET {{base}}/.well-known/agent-card.json
Accept: application/json

### 2. Another agent delegates a read: getOrder
POST {{base}}/a2a
Content-Type: application/a2a+json
A2A-Version: 1.0

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"SendMessage","params":{"message":{"messageId":"m1","role":"ROLE_USER","parts":[{"data":{"hapi":{"skillId":"getOrder","arguments":{"orderId":"A-1001"}}},"mediaType":"application/json"}]}}}

### 3. A write is not published -> "Skill is unavailable"
POST {{base}}/a2a
Content-Type: application/a2a+json
A2A-Version: 1.0

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"SendMessage","params":{"message":{"messageId":"m2","role":"ROLE_USER","parts":[{"data":{"hapi":{"skillId":"createOrder","arguments":{}}},"mediaType":"application/json"}]}}}

### 4. Plain text -> a clarification, never a guessed call
POST {{base}}/a2a
Content-Type: application/a2a+json
A2A-Version: 1.0

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"SendMessage","params":{"message":{"messageId":"m3","role":"ROLE_USER","parts":[{"text":"where is my order A-1001?"}]}}}
